<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Math on Benjamin Italiaander</title><link>https://tlnd.org/math/</link><description>Recent content in Math on Benjamin Italiaander</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://tlnd.org/math/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>KaTeX</title><link>https://tlnd.org/math/KaTeX_nl/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tlnd.org/math/KaTeX_nl/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤖 &lt;em&gt;Deze pagina is met AI vertaald uit het Engels. &lt;a href="https://tlnd.org/math/KaTeX/"&gt;Lees het origineel in het Engels&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even een geheugensteuntje voor het schrijven van formules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Een eenvoudige breuk:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-latex" data-lang="latex"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;\frac&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;4+b&lt;span class="nb"&gt;}{&lt;/span&gt;b-2&lt;span class="nb"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;$$\frac{4+b}{b-2}$$&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Uitgelijnde regels:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-latex" data-lang="latex"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;\begin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;aligned&lt;span class="nb"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; a&lt;span class="nb"&gt;_{&lt;/span&gt;ijk&lt;span class="nb"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; = 2 &lt;span class="k"&gt;\\&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;\text&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;omdat &lt;span class="nb"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;\|&lt;/span&gt;V&lt;span class="nb"&gt;_&lt;/span&gt;1 - V&lt;span class="nb"&gt;_&lt;/span&gt;2&lt;span class="k"&gt;\|&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span class="k"&gt;\max&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;_{&lt;/span&gt;i &lt;span class="k"&gt;\in&lt;/span&gt; [d]&lt;span class="nb"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; |V&lt;span class="nb"&gt;^&lt;/span&gt;i&lt;span class="nb"&gt;_&lt;/span&gt;1 - V&lt;span class="nb"&gt;^&lt;/span&gt;i&lt;span class="nb"&gt;_&lt;/span&gt;2|
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;\end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;aligned&lt;span class="nb"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;$$\begin{aligned}
&amp;amp; a_{ijk} = 2 \
&amp;amp; \text{omdat } |V_1 - V_2| = \max_{i \in [d]} |V^i_1 - V^i_2|
\end{aligned}$$&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Haakjes die meegroeien met de inhoud:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Ondersteunde functies (KaTeX)</title><link>https://tlnd.org/math/KaTeX_function_list_nl/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tlnd.org/math/KaTeX_function_list_nl/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
